Dragon Fury 0079 (Dragon Burst 0189): guest waits for the app while it is in the background

The app (Android) sets rex_background_wait, defined in the runtime next to rex_vdswap_hook (the xenos plugin is loaded
at run time). It waits while the game is off screen and says whether it waited. Called by the vsync worker before
each round (when it waited, the vblanks are counted again from then on, so the time spent stopped is not fired as a
burst of interrupts), by the command processor's idle loop instead of its 5 ms waits and before a WAIT_REG_MEM wait
(the vblank or the game it waits for does not come while stopped), and at the start of KeDelayExecutionThread and
NtYieldExecution, so guest threads that poll with sleeps or yields stop too. nullptr on the PC: nothing changes.


